      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "Please try to keep feedback focused on one item at a time! Feedback posts that request several different changes are challenging to track.\n\nThe feedback in this post is already tracked in several other posts:\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/avatar-marketplace/p/1642-remember-my-last-selected-avatar-submenu\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/avatar-marketplace/p/1642-restore-the-ability-to-move-favorites-from-other-favorite-avatar-categories\n\nVarious avatar management posts\n\nAs such, I will close this post to help keep the feedback boards organized. Please go vote on those posts!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-06-03T18:44:13.185Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The new avatar marketplace and favorites overhaul feels like a money funnel. VRChat is taking too much from creators’ earnings, forcing the marketplace into everyone’s face, and making basic avatar management worse. If you stop paying for VRC+, you can’t even move avatars out of your paid favorites unless you resubscribe. it’s just a trap.\n\nThis update feels predatory. I understand it’s important to get earnings to be able to upkeep the cost of the game, but this is not it. I won’t be paying for VRC+ or playing VRChat until this is addressed.",
